# Rust / Soroban
contracts/**/target/
contracts/**/Cargo.lock
# The fuzz crate compiles the contract's own src/lib.rs, so its lock is
# committed too: it has to resolve the same soroban-sdk as the contract, or the
# fuzzer would be exercising a different SDK than the one that ships.
!contracts/geoguard-ledger/fuzz/Cargo.lock

